-- Task batched-value-dependent-structure-select. The probability path
-- enumerates m's three values in a tensor map, and the inner `if` chooses
-- between two Either arms by a test on the map's element. That element is a
-- domain constant, the same for the whole batch, so the batched backend
-- keeps the select as a Python conditional. The dichotomy guard used to
-- refuse it as a value-dependent choice between structures.
main = draw m = (if Uniform < 0.3 then right True else if Uniform < 0.5 then right False else left False) in if isRight m then (if fromRightPartial m then right 5 else left True) else left False
